["03:36"]={
{"As I near Deadhorse, it’s \0033:36 a.m.\004 and seventeen below. Tall, sodium vapor lights spill on the road and there are no trees, only machines, mechanical shadows. There isn’t even a church. It tells you everything.","Zoopraxis","Richard Christian Matheson",true},
},
["03:37"]={
