},
["03:39"]={
{"23 October 1893 \0033:39 am\004. Upon further thought, I feel it necessary to explain that exile into the Master’s workshop is not an unpleasant fate. It is not simply some bare-walled cellar devoid of stimulation — quite the opposite.","The Clockwork Man","William Jablonsky",true},
},
["03:40"]={
